WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.162
The first common table expression remains at admission grain and adds previous discharge.

00:00:06.162 --> 00:00:13.472
The second common table expression keeps only admissions with a previous encounter and calculates the gap.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:18.957
The final query joins patient names and applies the thirty day classification.

00:00:18.957 --> 00:00:22.262
Run it and read the query stage by stage.

00:00:22.262 --> 00:00:29.582
Notice that the patient join is delayed until the final result because it is descriptive rather than needed for sequence

00:00:29.582 --> 00:00:30.382
logic.
